---
machine:
  type: controlplane
  nodeLabels:
    topology.kubernetes.io/zone: dmf-u
  install:
    diskSelector:
      model: Samsung SSD 870
    # 2026-07-25: RTX 3090 arrived, tested in the AOOSTAR AG02 dock (ASMedia ASM2464
    # bridge) - never stable, every attempt failed within 9-47s (pciehp hotplug command
    # 0x1038 timeout or earlier). thunderbolt.host_reset=0 was the only kernel arg that
    # helped at all; pci=realloc,assign-busses/pcie_aspm=off/pcie_port_pm=off all made it
    # worse and were reverted the same day. See schematic.yaml.j2 for full history.
    # 2026-07-28: swapped to a PELADN Link S-3 dock (Intel Barlow Ridge JHL9480 TB5
    # controller, not ASMedia) - RTX 3090 enumerated cleanly and held the link with zero
    # disconnects while running the baseline schematic, far more stable than any AG02
    # attempt. Tried switching to the eGPU schematic (NVIDIA driver extensions) the same
    # day and reverted it: `ext-nvidia-persistenced` blocks the entire boot on
    # /sys/bus/pci/drivers/nvidia existing, which only appears after a *successful*
    # nvidia.ko load - and nvidia.ko doesn't register-and-wait for a device to show up
    # later, it actively probes for a GPU at insmod time and hard-fails (ENODEV) if none
    # is present yet. Forcing it via machine.kernel.modules just produces an infinite
    # retry loop when the dock isn't linked up yet at that point in boot, and even with
    # the GPU connected the node repeatedly went from briefly-reachable back to fully
    # unresponsive. This is a real design mismatch between Talos's NVIDIA extension
    # (assumes an always-present GPU) and a Thunderbolt-hotplugged one - needs proper
    # research before trying again, not another live iteration. Back on the baseline
    # (link-stability-only) schematic for now; the PELADN link itself is proven solid.
    image: factory.talos.dev/installer/f004cb640e7e5c5cd0ba24a52737bad905b08bdd45451ae29886b5b689170ec2:v1.13.7 # baseline + thunderbolt.host_reset=0 test - see `just talos gen-schematic-id`
    wipe: false
---
apiVersion: v1alpha1
kind: HostnameConfig
hostname: k8s-2
